+# Parametric component scope
+
+The exact canonical setting, `all_components`, classifies arm and room cells in
+every gray component. `largest_component` first selects the uniquely largest
+gray component by occupied-cell count, then applies the same canonical
+classification only inside that selected component. Other components remain
+unchanged gray, so the selected component is a real input-derived intermediate
+consumed by the recoloring step.
+
+Episodes support 2–6 demonstrations and 1–4 stable query prefixes. The fourth
+query is a 30×30 three-component stress case with 100 gray cells, boundary
+contacts, six-room structure and multiple arm orientations. Settings, Racket
+programs and query answers remain controller-side.
